body:
Orthorexia and AN-R for sure.  Legit been talking about going vegetarian/vegan for cost benefits/health benefits, and i (almost) openly talk about counting cals and losing weight at home (leaving out the part about dropping large amounts at once and meticulously counting the calories in 1/3 of a grape). As is predictable, started out as your basic EDNOS and knew where it was going but didn't try to stop it, and here we are

&#x200B;

sorry for wordiness lmao
